        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 52.8,
          "end": 53.88,
          "en": "So we have two things here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 53.88,
          "end": 56.58,
          "en": "The first one is what if you don't even allow",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 56.58,
          "end": 61.58,
          "en": "for anyone outside the same website to access your server?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 62.01,
          "end": 63.57,
          "en": "So basically what I'm trying to say is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 63.57,
          "end": 66.06,
          "en": "what if you don't allow someone else to access it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 66.06,
          "end": 67.2,
          "en": "So what I'm trying to say is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 67.2,
          "end": 71.22,
          "en": "what if you simply disable the cross site access?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 71.22,
          "end": 74.34,
