          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 74.34,
          "end": 75.486,
          "en": "And the way you can do that is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 75.486,
          "end": 78.99,
          "en": "by setting the property here as same site.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 78.99,
          "end": 80.58,
          "en": "So if you type same site,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 80.58,
          "end": 82.28999999999999,
          "en": "you can see we have multiple options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 82.28999999999999,
          "end": 84.9,
          "en": "By default, it is lax, let's say strict.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 84.9,
          "end": 86.76,
          "en": "Now this will make sure that you can only access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 86.76,
          "end": 87.75,
          "en": "from the same website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 87.75,
          "end": 89.753,
          "en": "Now, this is one solution we have from CSRF. Okay?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 89.753,
          "end": 92.07,
          "en": "So this is a good idea to put it strict",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 92.07,
          "end": 94.41,
          "en": "and no one can access it now from the outside world.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 94.41,
          "end": 95.43,
          "en": "Now let's talk about the second part.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 95.43,
          "end": 97.65,
          "en": "The second part is when you talk about Rest API,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 97.65,
          "end": 98.67,
          "en": "this can be two type of rest.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 98.67,
          "end": 101.22,
          "en": "API, first is stateless, and second is stateful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 101.22,
          "end": 103.77000000000001,
          "en": "Now in the stateful, basically you maintain this session.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 103.77000000000001,
          "end": 106.28999999999999,
          "en": "And that's why every time you log in",
