        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 136.47,
          "end": 138.57,
          "en": "Every request will have the same session id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 138.57,
          "end": 140.52,
          "en": "What if you make it stateless?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 140.52,
          "end": 142.892,
          "en": "And most of the time when we use a REST application,",
